# Morven Student — Frontend environment configuration
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development and adjust as needed.
# The `.env` file is git-ignored and MUST NOT be committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_URL — the backend API base URL used by the frontend.
#
# DEVELOPMENT (default): point at your local backend.
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
#
# PRODUCTION: set this to the deployed backend's public URL. Railway must
# provide this as a build-time variable so the production bundle talks to
# the real backend (never localhost). There is NO default for production;
# if it is missing the frontend falls back to localhost for local dev only.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://YOUR-BACKEND-DOMAIN
#
# Do NOT hardcode a specific environment's domain here in a committed file.

# VITE_API_URL=
